  "question": {
    "text": "A real gas within a closed chamber at $27^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ undergoes the cyclic process as shown in figure. The gas obeys $P V^3=R T$ equation for the path $A$ to $B$. The net work done in the complete cycle is (assuming $R=8 \\mathrm{~J} / \\mathrm{mol} \\mathrm{K}$ ):\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/MaShLXI7MYXTuG2HJc9_KIJxN1dVYeOQKqX0uLnKwWc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ZDJCo",
      "text": "$20 \\mathrm{~J}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "WQiUb",
      "text": "$205 \\mathrm{~J}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Uiv0q",
      "text": "$-20 \\mathrm{~J}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d0QAA",
      "text": "$225 \\mathrm{~J}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{W}_{\\mathrm{AB}}=\\int \\mathrm{PdV} \\quad$ (Assuming $\\mathrm{T}$ to be constant)\n$\\begin{aligned} & =\\int \\frac{\\mathrm{RTdV}}{\\mathrm{V}^3} \\\\ & =\\mathrm{RT} \\int_2^4 \\mathrm{~V}^{-3} \\mathrm{dV} \\\\ & =8 \\times 300 \\times\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\frac{1}{4^2}-\\frac{1}{2^2}\\right]\\right) \\\\ & =225 \\mathrm{~J}\\end{aligned}$\n$\\begin{aligned}& \\mathrm{W}_{\\mathrm{BC}}=\\mathrm{P} \\int_4^2 \\mathrm{dV}=10(2-4)=-20 \\mathrm{~J} \\\\& \\mathrm{~W}_{\\mathrm{CA}}=0 \\\\& \\therefore \\mathrm{W}_{\\text {cycle }}=205 \\mathrm{~J}\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
